{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1783296456_830215_c8c0011f779f66fb582ab985ae949aeb.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>GodaStudio is a graphic apparel brand obsessed with bold, personality-driven design. We create premium T-shirts and sweatshirts for people who love pop culture, humor, gaming, horror, books, dogs, and everything in between — printed on garment-dyed fabrics built for comfort and made to stand out.</span></p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Every piece starts with a concept that means something — a inside joke, a fandom, a feeling. Our designs are sharp, expressive, and made for people who want their wardrobe to say something without saying a word.</span></p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>From heavyweight hoodies to soft everyday tees, our garments are chosen for their quality feel and rich color — because great design deserves a great canvas.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different:</p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We don't do generic. Every GodaStudio design is built around a specific passion, niche, or cultural moment — so when someone finds one of our shirts, it feels like it was made </span><em><span>for them</span></em><span>.</span></p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>A few things that set us apart:</span></p><ul class=\"_ul_1iy4o_146\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:28px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:4px 0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Niche-first design</span></strong> — We go deep on the fandoms and interests our customers actually care about, from horror and gaming to book lovers and dog obsessives</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Garment-dyed quality</span></strong> — Our tees and sweatshirts are printed on premium, garment-dyed blanks for a lived-in feel and rich, lasting color</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Bold, editorial style</span></strong> — Our product photography and design aesthetic are intentional and expressive — not catalog-bland</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Always expanding</span></strong> — We're constantly dropping new designs across new themes, so there's always something fresh</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>It's simple — share what you love and get paid for it.</span></p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Earn a </span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>$5 flat commission</span></strong><span> for every new customer you refer to GodaStudio. No minimums, no complicated tiers — just a straightforward reward every time someone discovers us through you for the first time.</span></p><ul class=\"_ul_1iy4o_146\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:28px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:4px 0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>$5 flat rate per sale</span></strong> — Earn $5 on every order placed through your unique link or coupon</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span>Tracked via your unique affiliate link or coupon</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span>Works across all our T-shirts, sweatshirts, and hoodies</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>New customer = first-time buyer only</span></li></ul><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>The more you share, the more you earn. Whether you post once a week or run a full content channel, every new fan you send our way counts.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us:</p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>The best promotion feels natural — share GodaStudio with the communities and audiences who already love what we design around.</span></p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>Best ways to promote:</span></strong></p><ul class=\"_ul_1iy4o_146\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:28px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:4px 0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Social media posts</span></strong> — Show off the designs on Instagram, TikTok, Pinterest, or Facebook. Lifestyle shots and unboxings perform great</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Niche communities</span></strong> — Share in Reddit threads, Facebook groups, or Discord servers built around gaming, horror, books, dogs, or whatever niche fits your audience</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Content &amp; reviews</span></strong> — Write a blog post, film a haul video, or do a honest review — our designs speak for themselves</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Stories &amp; reels</span></strong> — Short-form video content works especially well for apparel; show the fit, the feel, the vibe</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Email newsletters</span></strong> — If you have a list, a featured product spotlight or \"find your niche tee\" angle converts well</span></li></ul><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>Tips for success:</span></strong></p><ul class=\"_ul_1iy4o_146\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:28px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:4px 0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;\"><span>Lead with the niche — \"This shirt is literally made for horror fans\" beats a generic \"check out this tee\"</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span>Tag us and use your unique link in every post</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Fresh drops happen regularly, so there's always something new to feature</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information:</p><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>A few things to know before you apply:</span></p><ul class=\"_ul_1iy4o_146\" style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:28px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:4px 0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Cookie window</span></strong> — We use a standard tracking cookie so your referrals are properly attributed</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Payout</span></strong> — Commissions are paid out on a regular schedule once approved</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>$5 flat rate per sale</span></strong> — Earn $5 on every order placed through your unique link</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>No coupon stacking required</span></strong> — You don't need to offer a discount to drive conversions; our designs sell on their own</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Brand guidelines</span></strong> — We ask that affiliates represent GodaStudio authentically — no misleading claims, no spam, no unauthorized use of our logo or designs</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Content niches we love</span></strong> — Pop culture, gaming, horror, books, dogs, travel, humor, patriotic — if your audience overlaps with any of these, you're a great fit</span></li><li style=\"line-height:20px;margin-top:4px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:13px;\"><span>Questions?</span></strong> — Reach out anytime through the affiliate portal and we'll get back to you promptly</span></li></ul><p class=\"_p_1iy4o_107\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We're excited to grow with creators who genuinely connect with what we make. Let's build something together.</span></p></div></div>",
